title: Add statement store e2e integration tests
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Add 3 new zombienet-sdk e2e integration tests for the statement store subsystem:
      - **propagation_multi_node**: 4-node fan-out with data integrity verification
      - **expiration**: enforcement cycle cleanup of expired statements
      - **quota_enforcement**: AccountFull, NoAllowance, DataTooLarge rejections and priority-based eviction
    Add `spawn_network_with_custom_allowances()` helper for per-participant quota configuration.
    Register all 4 statement store tests (3 new + 1 existing) in CI matrix.
crates:
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: patch
- name: cumulus-zombienet-sdk-tests
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: patch
